              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "一 + 丿 + ㇏ becomes 大 (dà)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Write the horizontal first. Start the left-falling stroke above it and cross through it. Lift once more, return to the crossing, and fall long to the right."
